@@ -65,6 +65,18 @@ ## User Administration
 | Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
 | Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
 
+## Authentication
+
+Session-based, written in the app (no starter kit): Livewire full-page `Login` and `Register` (guests only), plus controllers for logout, password reset and e-mail verification.
+
+- **Login:** failed attempts are limited to 5 per lowercase e-mail + IP; the session is regenerated on success.
+- **Register:** limited to 5 attempts per IP; creates an unverified user, sends the verification mail and logs in.
+- **Passwords:** one app-wide rule (`Password::defaults()`): min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers.
+- **Home** (`/home`) requires `auth` + `verified`; unverified users are sent to the verification notice.
+- **Forgot password:** always answers with the same status (never reveals whether the e-mail exists); 6 requests/minute. A reset rotates `remember_token`.
+- **Verification link:** signed and throttled; only verifies the logged-in user (tampered id → 403).
+- **Locale:** default `pt_BR`, fallback `en`; screen text lives in `lang/{en,pt_BR}/ui.php`.
+
